# openspec/ holds spec documents (the version-controlled source of truth), not tooling
# artifacts. Ignore the openspec/ root (where local tooling files may be generated), but
# track the spec directories: changes/ and specs/.
openspec/*
!openspec/changes/
!openspec/specs/
